00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:19.000
and you don't know how to use it. So you're a surgeon using a robot, and this is a bit more in the future because the AI isn't really set in there, but that's a goal in terms of the future of work. So now the AI isn't working. Can you still perform the surgery? So there's that aspect that we need to be concerned about.

