I'm just wondering, since you're studying AI in professions that include things like elite sports, how does AI influence somebody who is an elite athlete athlete? I mean, you still have to perform if that's what you do. So what is AI doing for you and are you actually offloading anything to AI when you are an athlete? There is probably less that you're offloading. There could be decisions that you're making or learning or skills, but you're going to

