00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:33.000
They are fallible and people are fallible. But if we start leaning too much on the AI are forgetting about its fallibility, then we're not putting that shared cognition together. So we have the human intelligence, we have the artificial intelligence. And the idea is if we look first, we're more likely to find something

