00:20:33.000 --> 00:21:01.000
that maybe the AI is going to miss. But if we just look at what the AI says, we might not see what we would have caught before. So there's that concern. And people very much differ in how much they are biased towards leaning on an AI versus not. So there's some people who get complacent when an AI is available. There's some work that suggests, and this is in aviation and automation in general,

