00:23:25.000 --> 00:24:01.000
concern. There's a concern that maybe we will generally start expecting kind of immediate results more, not wanting to persist as much. There's been a little bit of work already in this space. This is from a pre-print, so of course you have to be careful with that because it hasn't been peer reviewed yet. But across multiple studies, they noted that when they were trying to learn a new problem-solving skill, and they used AI, and they got the answer, and then when it was taken away, people just gave up a lot more quickly. They got used to getting this immediate result,

